/ One transaction of the list in its own tbody, so a categorised line can replace it (categorise.turbo_stream).
/ Under the row, each uncategorised line with its suggestion and the controls to categorise it. Once no line waits
/ there, the category cell offers "Change" (transactions/_change_categories): never next to a suggestion on
/ screen, so a category chosen with it is the person's own label. `focus_change`: the answer to "Change" puts the
/ focus back on it.
- message = local_assigns[:message]
- review_lines = transaction_review_lines(transaction)
tbody id=dom_id(transaction, :list)
  tr
    td.whitespace-nowrap = l(transaction.occurred_on)
    td
      = link_to transaction_label(transaction), transaction_path(transaction), class: "data-grid-link font-medium"
      - if transaction.comment.present?
        .text-xs.text-ink-muted = transaction.comment.truncate(80)
    td.whitespace-nowrap = transaction.account.name
    td
      = transaction_categories(transaction)
      - if review_lines.empty?
        = render "transactions/change_categories", transaction:, link_params: { filter: filter.to_params }, autofocus: local_assigns[:focus_change]
    td.data-grid-num = receipt_money(transaction.amount, transaction.account.currency)
    td.whitespace-nowrap = transaction_status_badge(transaction)
  - if message
    tr
      td colspan="6"
        p.text-sm.font-medium.text-ink-display role="alert" = message
  - review_lines.each do |line|
    = render "transactions/review_line", transaction:, line:, filter:
